# DwarfUI tooltip migration plan

## Objective

Remove SoulSearch's legacy tooltip renderer and per-root tooltip agent, then
migrate all tooltip behavior to DwarfUI's standardized registration-driven
tooltip system.

## Linked documentation

- DwarfUI public tooltip API and runtime behavior:
  [../DwarfUI/README.md](../DwarfUI/README.md)
- DwarfUI tooltip registration architecture decision:
  [../DwarfUI/Docs/tooltip-registration-decision.md](../DwarfUI/Docs/tooltip-registration-decision.md)
- SoulSearch project history and prior tooltip changes:
  [project.todo](project.todo)

## Phase 0 - Baseline and guardrails

☐ Capture baseline tooltip behavior in SoulSearch before code changes:
  - main screen static tooltips;
  - dynamic row-hover tooltips in filter actions;
  - dynamic row-hover tooltips in pickers;
  - dynamic stat-list label and delta tooltips;
  - stats-overlay tooltip behavior.
☐ Record baseline local checks:
  - `Tools/Run-UnitTests.ps1` result;
  - `Tools/Build.ps1` result.
☐ Snapshot legacy tooltip entry points and dependencies:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui_tooltip.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui_tooltip.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/tooltip_agent.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/tooltip_agent.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/module_registry.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/module_registry.lua)

Exit gate: baseline behavior and automated check results are recorded.

## Phase 1 - Adopt DwarfUI tooltip dependency boundary

☐ Add DwarfUI tooltip registration dependency where SoulSearch currently owns
tooltip rendering lifecycle.
☐ Ensure SoulSearch relies on DwarfUI widget extension contracts (tooltip and
pointer attributes) rather than custom local tooltip stack ownership.
☐ Confirm DwarfUI runtime contract availability for local development:
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip.lua)
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip_registration.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/tooltip_registration.lua)
  - [../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/widget_extensions.lua](../DwarfUI/src/scripts_modinstalled/dwarfui/widget_extensions.lua)

Exit gate: SoulSearch code paths can reference DwarfUI tooltip APIs without
requiring legacy renderer ownership.

## Phase 2 - Migrate root ownership from local renderer to registration

☐ Remove SoulSearch root-level `self.tooltip` and `self.tooltip_agent`
construction from:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/main_screen.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-stats-overlay.lua)
☐ Remove per-frame tooltip update calls currently executed during render.
☐ Register tooltip-bearing controls with DwarfUI under the appropriate root.
☐ Verify main screen and overlay both resolve to the correct presentation
surface under DwarfUI transport selection.

Exit gate: SoulSearch no longer instantiates `SoulSearchTooltip` or
`TooltipAgent` in active UI roots.

## Phase 3 - Preserve and validate dynamic tooltip semantics

☐ Keep static tooltip strings intact and confirm visibility after migration.
☐ Validate dynamic tooltip mutation under pointer update for:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/filter_action_list.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/filter_action_list.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/searchable_picker.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/searchable_picker.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/unit_stats_list.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/unit_stats_list.lua)
☐ Confirm tooltip text providers remain correct:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/attribute_descriptions.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/attribute_descriptions.lua)
  - [race-filtering.md](race-filtering.md)

Exit gate: static and dynamic tooltips match pre-migration behavior.

## Phase 4 - Remove obsolete SoulSearch tooltip modules

☐ Remove legacy module files:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui_tooltip.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui_tooltip.lua)
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/tooltip_agent.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/ui/tooltip_agent.lua)
☐ Remove legacy debug script:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-tooltip-log.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/soulsearch-tooltip-log.lua)
☐ Update module registry and reload ordering to remove legacy contracts:
  - [../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/module_registry.lua](../src/scripts_modinstalled/internal/soulsearch/module_registry.lua)
☐ Keep or remove local pointer infrastructure only if still required by
non-tooltip behavior; document the decision.

Exit gate: no production code path imports legacy tooltip modules.

## Phase 5 - Test suite migration

☐ Retire or rewrite tests coupled to removed internals:
  - [../tests/ui_tooltip_spec.lua](../tests/ui_tooltip_spec.lua)
  - [../tests/tooltip_agent_spec.lua](../tests/tooltip_agent_spec.lua)
☐ Update registry and extension contract tests for the new dependency graph:
  - [../tests/module_registry_spec.lua](../tests/module_registry_spec.lua)
  - [../tests/widget_extensions_spec.lua](../tests/widget_extensions_spec.lua)
☐ Update component harnesses that currently construct
`SoulSearchTooltip`/`TooltipAgent`:
  - [../tests/component/filter_action_list.ds.lua](../tests/component/filter_action_list.ds.lua)
  - [../tests/component/pickers.ds.lua](../tests/component/pickers.ds.lua)
  - [../tests/component/results_panel.ds.lua](../tests/component/results_panel.ds.lua)
  - [../tests/component/unit_info_panel.ds.lua](../tests/component/unit_info_panel.ds.lua)
☐ Add characterization tests focused on behavior instead of legacy ownership:
  - tooltip visibility for static controls;
  - dynamic tooltip updates on hovered rows;
  - overlay tooltip display on active unit card.

Exit gate: tests assert user-visible tooltip behavior and all obsolete
internal-contract expectations are removed.

## Phase 6 - Validation and packaging

☐ Run full automated checks:
  - `Tools/Run-UnitTests.ps1`
  - `Tools/Build.ps1`
☐ Verify package and runtime load/reload do not reference removed tooltip
modules.
☐ Verify key runtime scenarios manually in Dwarf Fortress:
  - SoulSearch main screen;
  - stats overlay on unit card;
  - filter and picker hover tooltips;
  - result and stat column header tooltips.
☐ Update [project.todo](project.todo) with completion status only after exit
gates pass.

Exit gate: migration is complete, legacy tooltip system is removed, and
DwarfUI tooltips are the only active tooltip system in SoulSearch.